  "note": "Election of 12 members for the four wards of Newtownards Borough Council (three each) on 18 May 1955. There was a contest in all four wards after the withdrawal of Mr Henry M'Gimpsey in Castle Ward reduced the field to 17 for 12 seats. Defeated (ward not printed): J. Aigle (Lab.) 307, J. Nixon (Lab.) 308, J. R. H. Pinnons (Lab.) 247, D. Wilson 393, D. Moore (Lab.) 314. Martin was one of the four new members."
